1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
There's a few things I'm hoping to find today.
今天我希望能找到几样东西。

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:07,200
It's kind of risky to go thrifting with a goal because I feel like I always find the best stuff when I'm not looking for anything in particular.
带着明确目标去淘二手衣服有点冒险，因为我好像总是在没特别找什么时淘到最好的东西。

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,520
And the one thing I always tell people is to thrift with an open mind rather than a checklist.
我总是告诉大家，淘二手衣服要保持开放的心态，而不是拿着一张核对清单。

4
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,520
But there are a few things I've been wanting to make.
不过有几样东西我一直想做。

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,320
So my aim is to find like minimum three of these things.
所以我的目标是至少找到其中三样东西。

6
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,120
And then I can just look around to see what else I can find.
然后我就可以四处看看，还能发现什么。

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,960
So I want to find some vintage lace.
我想找一些复古蕾丝。

8
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:24,640
I feel like you can do so much with vintage lace and it's usually pretty easy to find.
我觉得复古蕾丝能做很多东西，而且通常挺容易找。

9
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:29,040
In a similar bracket I'd like to find some old blankets and sheets with some fun patterns.
类似的，我还想找一些带有有趣图案的旧毯子和床单。

10
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,600
I've also been seeing a lot of clothing made out of ties lately.
最近我还看见很多用领带做成的衣服。

11
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:36,390
And it seems easy enough maybe so I think old ties and scarves would be handy.
看起来好像也够简单吧，所以旧领带和围巾应该会派上用场。

12
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,760
Vintage graphic te's are usually pretty easy to find and you can do plenty with them so hopefully I can grab some of those.
复古印花 T 恤通常挺容易找到，也能做不少改造，希望能拿到几件。

13
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:44,240
And then we have keychains and jewelry and lastly.
然后还有钥匙扣和首饰，最后是……

14
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,670
Something that I've never really looked for before but I think would be interesting to find.
……我以前从没专门找过，但觉得找到会很有意思的东西。

15
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:56,310
Which is vintage crochet and sewing patterns.
那就是复古钩织和缝纫纸样。

16
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,960
This is the biggest one out of the three I usually go to.
这是我平时去的三家店里最大的一家。

17
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:01,840
So I figured it'd be my best bet to find what I was after.
所以我觉得这里最有希望找到我想要的东西。

18
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:05,999
I went straight to the textile section and immediately spotted this old lace pillow cover.
我直奔家用纺织品区，立刻发现了这个旧蕾丝枕套。

19
00:01:05,999 --> 00:01:08,560
I've been wanting to make a handbag out of vintage lace.
我一直想用复古蕾丝做一个手提包。

20
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:12,639
And the way that this pillowcase has been stitched is actually perfect for that kind of flip.
而且这个枕套的缝法，正好适合做那样的翻新改造。

21
00:01:12,639 --> 00:01:16,950
I also found a super cute lace panel that I think would be perfect for a top.
我还找到一块超级可爱的蕾丝布片，我觉得很适合做上衣。

22
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:20,870
That would be so cute as a top that 2.
“做成上衣会好可爱。那个，2。”

23
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:24,479
I kept digging through the rest of the home textiles and I found a few cute bits.
我继续翻找其他家用纺织品，又找到几个可爱的小东西。

24
00:01:24,479 --> 00:01:28,560
But nothing that really fit my color palette which is something to keep in mind when thrifting.
但没有真正符合我配色的，这也是淘衣服时要记住的一点。

25
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:32,630
A few things didn't go well in this next part my plan for the ties didn't go super well.
接下来有几件事不太顺利。我关于领带的计划就进行得不太好。

26
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:36,000
I did purchase two ties but that's obviously nowhere near enough to make a top.
我确实买了两条领带，但显然离做一件上衣需要的数量还差得很远。

27
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,160
So I think I'll gradually just collect ties I like and then do that as a future project.
所以我想以后慢慢收集喜欢的领带，把那个当作未来的项目。

28
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:45,200
I also took one look at the men's tees and I knew I wasn't going to have any luck in the graphic te's department.
我看了一眼男士 T 恤区，就知道自己在印花 T 恤这方面不会有什么收获。

29
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:50,000
So there goes that idea and then I didn't have much luck when looking through the sewing and crochet patterns.
所以这个想法也没戏了。接着翻缝纫和钩织纸样，也没什么运气。

30
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,000
I finally started looking through the clothing racks and immediately found this midi skirt hidden away.
最后我开始看衣架上的衣服，马上发现了这条藏在里面的中长裙。

31
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,880
I actually can't believe I found something so cute so quickly.
我真不敢相信这么快就找到这么可爱的东西。

32
00:01:56,880 --> 00:02:01,200
This felt like a good omen because I kept finding garment after garment that I fell in love with.
这感觉是个好兆头，因为我接着一件又一件找到让我爱上的衣服。

33
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:04,640
I literally spent more on this day than I've ever spent on a thrifting trip.
我这一天花的钱，真的比以前任何一次二手购物都多。

34
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:08,560
And I don't know if it's because the gods knew I needed help with my video or if it's just.
不知道是不是那些神灵知道我拍视频需要帮助，还是只是……

35
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:13,840
Because I went first thing on a monday morning either way I feel like the luckiest girl ever for some of my finds.
……因为我周一一早就去了。反正能淘到这些东西，我感觉自己是最幸运的女孩。

36
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:16,240
This is why I always say you have to try things on when thrifting.
所以我才总说，淘二手衣服时一定要试穿。

37
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:22,000
I can't believe how many people I know who actually don't try things on properly prior to purchase just because of how cheap the item is.
我认识很多人，只因为东西便宜，购买前就不认真试穿，真让我难以置信。

38
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,818
I always like trying items on and just playing around with their shape.
我总喜欢把衣服试上身，再调整、试试它们的形状。

39
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:27,749
Just to see if it's even worth taking the item home.
看看这件东西到底值不值得带回家。

40
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:30,240
They look cute though so cute.
不过穿起来很可爱，真可爱。

41
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:34,640
I think with this shop in the end I purchased probably just over half of what I had in my basket.
最后在这家店，我大概买了篮子里稍微超过一半的东西。

42
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:39,520
I still can't get over some of these pieces I found like the thrifting gods really blessed me on this day.
我还是难以相信找到的这些单品，二手购物之神这天真是眷顾我。

43
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,599
The second store I went to is usually my favorite.
我去的第二家店通常是我的最爱。

44
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:46,400
I think it gets all the good stuff because it's the first in line of thrift stores so people just drop their stuff off there.
我觉得好东西都先到那里，因为它是那一排二手店里的第一家，大家就把东西送去那里。

45
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:48,400
But I really struggle to find a lot here.
但我在这家真是很难找到多少东西。

46
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:53,200
Although I will say the pieces I did purchase from this store are probably my favorite pieces from the day.
不过得说，在这家买到的几件，大概是我当天最喜欢的。

47
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:57,200
I found this plaid skirt which I thought the fabric maybe had potential but it was a bit.
我发现了这条格纹裙，觉得面料可能有潜力，但它有点……

48
00:02:57,200 --> 00:03:00,720
Too close in color to one of my old school uniforms and it kind of triggered me.
……太接近我以前某套校服的颜色了，有点勾起不好的联想。

49
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:04,160
So I left it there I did find this tie but the fact that it fell off the hook.
所以我把它留在那里。我确实找到这条领带，但镜头里它从钩子上掉下来了。

50
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:07,910
In this clip told me not to buy it so that's the first thing that I left behind here.
于是我就觉得这是在告诉我别买它。所以这是我在这家第一件放弃的东西。

51
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:10,720
This skirt however it's unbelievable that I found this.
不过这条裙子，我居然能找到，太不可思议了。

52
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:13,280
The waistband with the embroidery is actually everything to me.
这个带刺绣的腰头，真的完全击中我的喜好。

53
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:16,319
And I don't think I'll ever be more in love with a feature on a garment.
我觉得自己再也不会这么爱一件衣服上的某个细节了。

54
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:18,879
This dress I thought had potential until I tried it on.
这条连衣裙我本来觉得有潜力，直到我试穿以后。

55
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:21,680
And then I realized the coloring completely washed me out.
之后我发现这个颜色完全让我显得没气色。

56
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:24,960
Which then made me leave behind this scarf in similar coloring.
这也让我放弃了这条颜色相近的围巾。

57
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:30,879
But then this scarf literally made me feel like I was glowing and I think it will make the most beautiful summer dress.
但这条围巾真的让我觉得自己在发光，我觉得它能做成最漂亮的夏日连衣裙。

58
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,869
And lastly I found this suede jacket.
最后我还找到了这件麂皮外套。

59
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:35,200
Normally I don't thrift jackets as we come into summer.
通常快入夏的时候，我不会在二手店买外套。

60
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:39,680
Because I know it's just going to sit in my wardrobe untouched for months but my boyfriend spotted it.
因为我知道它会在衣柜里好几个月都不被碰。但男朋友发现了它。

61
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:43,759
And told me to try it on just to see and I unfortunately did fall in love.
他让我试穿看看，结果很“不幸”，我还真爱上了。

62
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,920
It's actually brand new with the tag still on it.
它其实全新，标签都还在。

63
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:48,240
I did end up buying it and I don't regret a thing.
我最后还是买了，而且完全不后悔。
